WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.300
Open Reports starts with working examples. Choose Invoice so you can make your first change without facing a blank page.

2
00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:16.800
The designer puts the report in the center, its structure on the left, and settings on the right. Select any item to inspect it.

3
00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:24.467
Double-click the company name on the page, type your own, and press Enter. The canvas updates immediately.

4
00:00:24.467 --> 00:00:31.833
Run Preview to see the PDF the server produces. Check its pages and download the result when it looks right.

5
00:00:31.833 --> 00:00:40.567
Have an existing Word form? Import its DOCX file. Open Reports tells you what converted and what needs a closer look.

6
00:00:40.567 --> 00:00:47.067
Open the editable draft. From here you can adjust the layout and connect fields to your own data.

7
00:00:47.067 --> 00:00:56.267
You can also choose one JRXML file or a folder. Review the migration issues and data bindings before using an imported report.

8
00:00:56.267 --> 00:01:05.567
For totals across categories, open the crosstab example. Select it to change rows, columns, and values in Properties.

9
00:01:05.567 --> 00:01:15.000
When the report is ready, export a PDF, an editable Word file, Excel or CSV data, or keep its JSON definition.

10
00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:22.000
Not sure what to try next? What can I do explains each feature and opens the right starting point.

11
00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:28.500
Try the live demo, make one change, and tell us where the experience can improve.
